{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aCYjjQNAhV1794887487.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。</p><p></p><p>審訊踏入第39日，蔡天鳳前大伯鄺港傑繼續作供，由主控、資深大律師郭莎樂盤問。郭莎樂先問及案發當天，鄺港傑將七人車駛到大美督的情況，指其弟弟鄺港智無下車，因為身上衣物有血。鄺港傑不同意，稱沒見到有人毆打。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI-1100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VNqFjdk5N61794887500.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>控方之後引述法醫證供指，蔡天鳳頭部很有可能被鎚襲擊七下，鄺港傑稱沒看到發生毆打。郭莎樂質疑說「如果不是你弟弟做，咁邊個做？」之後鄺港傑同意指，是鄺港智殺死蔡天鳳。</p><p></p><p>控方質疑鄺港智衣物被血漬弄濕，鄺港傑不同意，指弟弟當時哭泣20至30分鐘，接近崩潰並全身出汗。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.457913+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:40.151463+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:41:45.795445+00:00","content_hash":"b3f88441b4b94a153e99101c0ea481ce7ba9b6a736adb0656d49861baa98c3ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.457913+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}